<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Dae Han buys 23,000T wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Dae Han buys 23,000T wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dae Han Flour Mills Co Ltd said on Thursday it has bought 23,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat from Japan's Mitsui and Company.</p>
<p>A company official said shipment was set for January 5-February 5 to the western port of Inchon.  </p>
<p>Details for the results are as follow:</p>
<p>  Type of Wheat		Tonne	Price/T (FOB)</p>
<p>  Soft White		  8,500	 $183.20</p>
<p>(protein max 10.8%)</p>
<p>  Soft White		  1,000	 $188.70</p>
<p>(protein max 9.5%)</p>
<p>  Hard Red Winter	   6,500	 $192.10</p>
<p>  Dark Northern Spring    7,000	 $197.10</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
